  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: mysogynous; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man pointing at a woman while text overlays read 'you see that?? it means get the fuck back to the kitchen.' This juxtaposition maps the visual of a woman in traditional attire with the text enforcing a harmful stereotype that women belong in the kitchen, which is a classic misogynistic trope. The intent is to reinforce the idea that women's place is domestic, which is a form of gender-based discrimination and objectification. The meme uses the image to amplify and spread this harmful stereotype, making it a misogynous meme.",
